{"slug": "iceberg-lettuce-with-blue-cheese-dressing", "nyt_id": 1013103, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1013103-iceberg-lettuce-with-blue-cheese-dressing", "name": "Iceberg Lettuce With Blue Cheese Dressing", "author": "Mark Bittman", "description": "", "servings": {"text": "8 servings", "min": 8, "max": 8, "yield_type": "servings"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": null, "cook_minutes": null, "total_minutes": 5, "raw": {"total": "PT5M"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "1 cup yogurt, preferably whole milk", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "cup", "item": "yogurt", "preparation": "preferably whole milk", "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "½ cup crumbled blue cheese", "group": null, "quantity": 0.5, "unit": "cup", "item": "crumbled blue cheese", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "1 tablespoon freshly squeezed lemon juice, or more as needed", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "freshly squeezed lemon juice", "preparation": "or more as needed", "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "Salt", "group": null, "quantity": null, "unit": null, "item": "salt", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "ground black pepper", "group": null, "quantity": null, "unit": null, "item": "ground black pepper", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "1 head iceberg lettuce, cored and cut into 8 wedges", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "head", "item": "iceberg lettuce", "preparation": "cored and cut into 8 wedges", "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "½ cup toasted and chopped hazelnuts, pecans or walnuts, optional", "group": null, "quantity": 0.5, "unit": "cup", "item": "toasted and chopped hazelnuts", "preparation": "pecans or walnuts, optional", "optional": true}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Mash yogurt with blue cheese, lemon juice, a pinch of salt, and a grinding or two of pepper. Taste and adjust the seasoning, adding more lemon juice if necessary."}, {"position": 2, "text": "Place each wedge of iceberg lettuce on a plate, drizzle with dressing and sprinkle with nuts if using."}], "nutrition": {"source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "calories": 103.875, "protein_g": 4.5, "carbohydrates_g": 5.2, "fat_g": 7.9, "saturated_fat_g": 2.5, "unsaturated_fat_g": 0.7, "trans_fat_g": null, "cholesterol_mg": 9.4, "sodium_mg": 265.1, "fiber_g": 1.6, "sugar_g": 3.2, "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": [], "diet": [], "course": ["green-salad"], "meal": [], "occasion": [], "other": ["blue-cheese", "easy", "iceberg-lettuce", "quick", "weeknight"]}, "images": [{"url": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2014/04/01/dining/lettuce-blue-cheese/lettuce-blue-cheese-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600-v2.jpg", "alt": "", "primary": true}, {"url": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2014/04/01/dining/lettuce-blue-cheese/lettuce-blue-cheese-superJumbo.jpg", "alt": "", "primary": false}, {"url": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2014/04/01/dining/lettuce-blue-cheese/lettuce-blue-cheese-facebookJumbo-v2.jpg", "alt": "", "primary": false}], "rating": {"average": 4.0, "count": 249}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "2010-04-07", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T01:42:28Z", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
{"slug": "iced-coffee-sundaes", "nyt_id": 1013798, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1013798-iced-coffee-sundaes", "name": "Iced Coffee Sundaes", "author": "Alice Hart", "description": "This ice cream sundae is born of both Vietnamese cà phê sữa đá, or dark roast coffee dripped over condensed milk, and Italian affogato, or espresso poured over ice cream. Here, a sort of granita made with very strong coffee is layered with a sweetened cream mixture, and then doused in a chocolatey coffee syrup. It’s a relatively lengthy endeavor, but one well worth doing. The individual parts must be made ahead of time, so plan accordingly.", "servings": {"text": "6 servings", "min": 6, "max": 6, "yield_type": "servings"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": null, "cook_minutes": null, "total_minutes": 45, "raw": {"total": "PT45M"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "1 cup granulated sugar", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "cup", "item": "granulated sugar", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "3 ½ cups very strong hot black coffee", "group": null, "quantity": 3.5, "unit": "cup", "item": "very strong hot black coffee", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "2 teaspoons cocoa powder", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "tsp", "item": "cocoa powder", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "1 ½ cups sweetened condensed milk", "group": null, "quantity": 1.5, "unit": "cup", "item": "sweetened condensed milk", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "2 cups light cream", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "unit": "cup", "item": "light cream", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "1 cup crème fraîche or heavy cream", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "cup", "item": "crème fraîche or heavy cream", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "1 teaspoon vanilla extract", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "unit": "tsp", "item": "vanilla extract", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 8, "raw": "A pinch of salt", "group": null, "quantity": null, "unit": null, "item": "a pinch of salt", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "¼ cup dark chocolate shards, optional", "group": null, "quantity": 0.25, "unit": "cup", "item": "dark chocolate shards", "preparation": "optional", "optional": true}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Mix ½ cup of the sugar in 2 ¼ cups of the hot coffee until it dissolves. Pour into a shallow lidded container and cool. In a bowl, combine the remaining 1 ¼ cups coffee and ½ cup sugar with cocoa powder; stir until the sugar dissolves to make a syrup, cover, and refrigerate."}, {"position": 2, "text": "Whisk together the condensed milk, light cream, crème fraîche, vanilla and salt, and pour into a shallow lidded container. Place both shallow lidded containers in the freezer for 2 hours."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Remove condensed milk mixture (ice cream) from the freezer, and whisk vigorously, breaking down the ice crystals until the texture is smooth. Return to freezer to set firm before scooping, about 4 hours or overnight."}, {"position": 4, "text": "Remove coffee mixture (granita) from freezer and rake the surface with the tines of a fork to form icy crystals. Return it to the freezer and repeat this raking every hour for about three more hours, until the texture is free-flowing but completely crystalline. At this point, it may be frozen overnight. Rake over again before serving to loosen."}, {"position": 5, "text": "To serve, place scoops of the ice cream into glasses or bowls, alternating each scoop with coffee granita. Douse with coffee syrup, scatter with chocolate shards, if using, and serve immediately."}], "nutrition": {"source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "calories": 731.1666666666666, "protein_g": 9.6, "carbohydrates_g": 83.0, "fat_g": 41.9, "saturated_fat_g": 25.3, "unsaturated_fat_g": 1.4, "trans_fat_g": 0.3, "cholesterol_mg": 136.7, "sodium_mg": 165.2, "fiber_g": 1.0, "sugar_g": 80.4, "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": ["asian"], "diet": [], "course": ["dessert-ice-creams-and-sorbets"], "meal": [], "occasion": [], "other": ["chocolate", "coffee", "summer"]}, "images": [{"url": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2014/04/03/dining/vietnamcoffee-still/vietnamcoffee-still-superJumbo.jpg", "alt": "", "primary": true}, {"url": "https://static01.nyt.com/images/2014/04/03/dining/vietnamcoffee-still/vietnamcoffee-still-facebookJumbo-v2.jpg", "alt": "", "primary": false}], "rating": {"average": 4.0, "count": 88}, "video_url": "https://vp.nyt.com/video/2024/07/10/120734_1_Iced-Coffee-Sundaes-Vertical-Video_wg_480p.mp4", "comment_count": null, "published_at": "2011-08-17", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T02:01:54Z", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
